WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.361 --> 00:00:00.893
- Ski trip!

00:00:00.893 --> 00:00:02.355
- Ski trip!

00:00:02.355 --> 00:00:03.681
- You guys have your socks?

00:00:03.681 --> 00:00:04.312
Gloves?

00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:05.026
Long johns?

00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:05.815
- Check, check.

00:00:05.815 --> 00:00:07.010
Do you guys have your hats?

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:07.518
- Yeah.

00:00:07.518 --> 00:00:08.927
- Yeast infection ointment.

00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:10.580
- Che-- (laughter)

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.903
- Okay, very funny guys.

00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:13.982
- Do you guys have your ski jackets?

00:00:13.982 --> 00:00:15.284
Cause we need those.

00:00:15.284 --> 00:00:17.054
- Duh!

00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:20.063
- Shit, I forgot that at my mom's house.

00:00:20.063 --> 00:00:21.278
- Oh, Allie, OK.

00:00:21.278 --> 00:00:23.070
Do you think you go can run and grab it and

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.660
be back in like a hour so we can

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.444
leave and miss traffic?

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.617
- Sure.

00:00:28.617 --> 00:00:30.206
- Ski trip!

00:00:30.206 --> 00:00:31.956
(singing)

00:00:31.956 --> 00:00:33.784
- Ski trip.

00:00:34.751 --> 00:00:36.912
(calm music)

00:00:41.887 --> 00:00:43.459
(knocks)

00:00:44.937 --> 00:00:46.068
- Hello.

00:00:46.068 --> 00:00:49.481
- Hey, I just wanna grab my ski jacket and leave.

00:00:49.481 --> 00:00:51.006
- And to see your mother?

00:00:51.006 --> 00:00:53.000
- Uh, the one who remembers Moonlight Sonata

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.987
and not her daughter, you talking about the same--

00:00:55.987 --> 00:00:58.430
Oh, humor, it's a defense mechanism.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.009
- Who's this, Jess?

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:14.157
I used to have a vest like this once.

00:01:18.238 --> 00:01:20.621
- I'm just going to get my jacket.

00:01:22.323 --> 00:01:24.281
- C'mon, let's go to the dining room.

00:01:24.281 --> 00:01:24.862
Tea time.

00:01:29.902 --> 00:01:33.642
(clothes rustling)

00:01:38.342 --> 00:01:43.579
(sad music)

00:01:52.939 --> 00:01:54.988
- You hate me!

00:01:54.988 --> 00:01:57.700
- What reason is there to hate you?

00:01:59.606 --> 00:02:02.134
(laughter)

00:02:02.134 --> 00:02:04.657
- Told you you hate me.

00:02:06.156 --> 00:02:08.962
- A flower in a vase blooms no different

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:11.628
than it does in a plastic cup.

00:02:11.628 --> 00:02:14.043
Love is what keeps it alive.

00:02:14.495 --> 00:02:17.197
If I'm your water, will you be mine?

00:02:18.068 --> 00:02:18.791
- Okay.

00:02:19.051 --> 00:02:19.545
- Okay.

00:02:19.545 --> 00:02:20.848
(laughter)

00:02:22.795 --> 00:02:25.499
(heavy breathing)

00:02:28.075 --> 00:02:30.944
- Drink all the way up, okay, swallow.

00:02:30.944 --> 00:02:33.217
- I'm really sorry about earlier.

00:02:33.217 --> 00:02:37.243
- I didn't know we were having guests, Jess.

00:02:39.189 --> 00:02:40.987
Who are you, dear?

00:02:42.401 --> 00:02:45.050
Love is what keeps it alive.

00:02:48.437 --> 00:02:51.057
- Just someone who loves you very much.

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:52.738
- Isn't that nice?

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.781
Yeah, let's finish our tea.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:04.510
(calm music)

